# Smart Interview Evaluator

## Project Description

Smart Interview Evaluator is a Python-based interview assessment system that helps candidates practice Python interview questions and automatically evaluates their performance.

The system allows candidates to register, attend a Python MCQ test, receive their score and percentage, and store their results using an SQLite database.

## Features

- Candidate registration
- Email validation
- Python interview MCQ test
- Automatic answer evaluation
- Score calculation
- Percentage calculation
- Candidate data storage
- Test result storage
- SQLite database integration
- 20 Python interview questions

## Technologies Used

- Python
- SQLite
- VS Code
- Git & GitHub

